OL,3,GNEWSAO'Dowd accuses government of
OL,4,Arefusing to fund Stormont fairly
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Finance Minister, John O'Dowd, has
OL,7,Faccused the secretary of state of
OL,8,Fseeking to tax "workers, families and
OL,9,Fbusinesses" in Northern Ireland because
OL,10,Fthe government "refuses to fund it
OL,11,Ffairly".
OL,13,FNo resolution was reached in
OL,14,Fnegotiations between executive parties
OL,15,Fand Sir Chris Bryant on a budget deal
OL,16,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
