OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAO'Dowd accuses government of
OL,4,Arefusing to fund Stormont fairly
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland secretary has said
OL,7,Fthat it is not his "job" to set a
OL,8,Fbudget and that it is the
OL,9,Fresponsibility of the Northern Ireland
OL,10,FExecutive, adding there was "no more
OL,11,Fmoney".
OL,13,FHe is understood to have presented a
OL,14,Fset of conditions, including revenue
OL,15,Fraising, to be attached to any
OL,16,Fpotential deal on a Stormont budget.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
